            "description": "KGEditor\n========\n\nCode for our paper \u201cEditing Language Model-based Knowledge Graph\nEmbeddings\u201d.\n\nTo use as a python module\n=========================\n\n::\n\n   pip install -kgeditor\n\nRun the experiments\n===================\n\nTraining\n--------\n\nEdit Task\n~~~~~~~~~\n\nTo train the KGEditor model in the paper on the dataset ``E-FB15k237``,\nrun the command below. For another dataset ``E-WN18RR`` just replacing\nthe dataset name will be fine.\n\n.. code:: shell\n\n   ./scripts/kgeditor_fb15k237_edit.sh\n\nAdd Task\n~~~~~~~~\n\nTo train the KGEditor model in the paper on the dataset ``A-FB15k237``,\nrun the command below. For another dataset ``A-WN18RR`` just replacing\nthe dataset name will be fine.\n\n.. code:: shell\n\n   ./scripts/kgeditor_fb15k237_add.sh\n\nModels\n======\n\nThis\n`folder <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EOHdg8rC9iwgSyKl5RnEv9z6ATW5Ntbr?usp=share_link>`__\ncontains the base models used for this work.\n",
